      "name": "Receive New Lead"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI Lead Qualification Specialist.\n\nAnalyze the following lead:\n\nName: {{ $json.body.name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.body.email }}\nPhone: {{ $json.body.phone }}\nCompany: {{ $json.body.company }}\nMessage: {{ $json.body.message }}\n\nEvaluate the lead based on:\n- Buying intent\n- Business need\n- Urgency\n- Potential business value\n- Clarity of request\n\nAssign a score from 1 to 100.\n\nClassification rules:\n80-100 = High-Value Lead\n50-79 = Qualified Lead\n1-49 = Low-Value Lead\n\nUrgency must be exactly one of:\nHigh\nMedium\nLow\n\nDo not invent information. If information is missing, treat it as unknown.\n\nReturn ONLY the following five lines.\nDo not include explanations, headings, Markdown, bullet points, or additional text.\n\nLEAD_SCORE: [number]\nCLASSIFICATION: [High-Value Lead / Qualified Lead / Low-Value Lead]\nURGENCY: [High / Medium / Low]\nREASON: [brief explanation in one sentence]\nRECOMMENDED_ACTION: [brief recommended next action in one sentence]",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -224
      ],
      "id": "7a3939e5-362a-4a5c-bfd2-be5c1ed62ffb",
      "name": "AI Lead Qualification"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const output = $input.first().json.output;\n\nconst lines = output.split('\\n');\n\nconst result = {};\n\nfor (const line of lines) {\n  const separator = line.indexOf(':');\n\n  if (separator === -1) continue;\n\n  const key = line.substring(0, separator).trim();\n  const value = line.substring(separator + 1).trim();\n\n  switch (key) {\n    case 'LEAD_SCORE':\n      result.lead_score = Number(value);\n      break;\n\n    case 'CLASSIFICATION':\n      result.classification = value;\n      break;\n\n    case 'URGENCY':\n      result.urgency = value;\n      break;\n\n    case 'REASON':\n      result.reason = value;\n      break;\n\n    case 'RECOMMENDED_ACTION':\n      result.recommended_action = value;\n      break;\n  }\n}\n\nconst originalLead = $('Receive New Lead').first().json.body;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ...originalLead,\n      ...result\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        304,
        -224
      ],
      "id": "a45b4a84-c42f-424a-bdf5-36f4c5962ec4",
      "name": "Parse Lead Qualification"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 3
